+# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only
+#
+# RTL8188GU Wireless LAN device configuration
+#
+config RTL8188GU
+tristate "Realtek RTL8710B/RTL8188GU USB WiFi"
+depends on MAC80211 && USB
+help
+  This is the driver for the Realtek RTL8710B chipset used in
+  RTL8188GU USB WiFi dongles.
+
+  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the module
+  will be called 8188gu.
